ender\\blender.exe`, pure CPU EEVEE).\n\nOWNERSHIP & STRICT BOUNDARIES:\n- You OWN: `pipeline/v5_anim.py`, `pipeline/v5_clay.py`, `pipeline/v5_stills.py`, `pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py`, `LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend`, `LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend`, `renders_v5/test/*`, `renders_v5/stills/*`, `renders_v5/clay_stills/clay_test_*.jpg`, and final documentation sync in `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, `docs/README_V5.md`.\n- DO NOT TOUCH: `pipeline/v5_env.py`, `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` (read-only input!), `textures/*`, `pipeline/mux_*.sh`, `pipeline/synth_sfx.py`, or `renders_v5/clay_frames/` (preserve the 2161 rendered clay frames!).\n- CPU RULE: NEVER start a full 2161-frame render (`--render`, `render_v5.py`, `render_clay.py`). Validate via 26-shot 1080p keyframe stills (~1 min total).\n- Mention discipline: `@name` wakes that agent. Do not CC. Tag `@verifier` when ready for final QA; tag `@coordinator` only if blocked.\n\nMISSION — Upgrade V5 Animation, 26 Cameras, Clay/Viewport Pipeline & Stills:\n1) Preserve ALL 5 hard physics rules in `pipeline/v5_anim.py` (`t` interpolation, `heading_deg`, `racing_xy`, `LINEAR` keyframes, lateral G <= `15.0 + 0.00714 v^2`, `Bone_Root.z = 0.012`, `clip_start=0.5`, `clip_end=9000`).\n2) Check `read_board` for `@verifier`'s Round 1 camera/rig audit findings. You can read `v5_anim.py`, `v5_clay.py`, `v5_viewport_fast.py`, `v5_stills.py` and develop/test against the existing `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` immediately (`--test ...` outputs to `renders_v5/test/`).\n3) Implement high-value upgrades:\n   - Camera Line-of-Sight & Framing Polish: Fix any camera obstructions/clipping reported by `@verifier` (or found by your own camera-to-car raycast check in `v5_anim.py` self-test — add an automated `[check] camera occlusion` self-check to `v5_anim.py`!). Add subtle, physically grounded camera dynamics: gentle horizon roll coupling on chase/onboard cameras in high-G corners, and deterministic micro-vibration (seeded noise scaled by speed